<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Wednesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	  1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.70 /10.60    11.10 /11.00   11.60 /11.50</p>
<p>Citibank		 10.675/10.625   11.075 /11.05  11.55 /11.50</p>
<p>Hong Kong Bank	 10.7/10.625     11.125 /11.025 11.6 /11.5</p>
<p>Multinational	  10.70 /10.6     11.05 /11	11.575/11.475</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   10.75 /10.65    11.075/11.025  11.6 /11.5</p>
<p>Security Bank	  10.7/10.65	11.1/11.05     11.6/11.5</p>
<p>PNB			10.70 /10.60    11.11/11	 11.625/11.55</p>
<p>PCI			10.675/10.575   11.1/11.03     11.6/11.5</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
